########################################
# Approved exception — enforcement only
########################################
# Re-includes non-confidential Amazon Ads tabular exports under evidence/.
# The governing decision is owned by evidence/README.md
# ("Git Filing — Non-Confidential Tabular Exports"). This file enforces it and
# does not define it. Scope is deliberately narrow: evidence/ only, .csv/.xlsx
# only. All other commercial-data exclusions above remain in force everywhere.
!evidence/**/*.csv
!evidence/**/*.xlsx